
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Shahzad Control Center</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#0b1020;color:#f5f7ff;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding:20px}
header{padding:22px 0}
h1{font-size:27px;margin:0 0 8px}
p{color:#aab5d0;line-height:1.6}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:14px}
.card{background:#151e33;border:1px solid #2a3855;
border-radius:16px;padding:18px;min-height:130px}
.icon{font-size:26px}
h3{margin-bottom:8px}
button{background:#4c78ff;color:white;border:0;
border-radius:10px;padding:12px;width:100%;font-size:15px}
.status{color:#ffd479;font-size:13px}
footer{margin-top:25px;color:#8491ad;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<p>SHAHZAD MANDHRO / PERSONAL SYSTEM</p>
<h1>Shahzad Control Center</h1>
<p>Welcome, Shahzad! Apne personal system ka dashboard.</p>
</header>

<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">📱</div>
<h3>Phone Status</h3>
<p>Phone abhi connect nahi hai.</p>
<span class="status">Not connected</span>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🔋</div>
<h3>Battery</h3>
<p>Battery status app connection ke baad milega.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">📁</div>
<h3>My Files</h3>
<p>Apni files ke liye future module.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🌐</div>
<h3>My Website</h3>
<p>Apni website aur settings manage karein.</p>
<button onclick="alert('Website module abhi tayyar karna hai.')">Open</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🔐</div>
<h3>Security</h3>
<p>Secure login aur permissions agle marhale mein.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🖥️</div>
<h3>Remote Access</h3>
<p>Phone connection abhi configure nahi hua.</p>
<span class="status">Setup pending</span>
</div>
</div>

<footer>
<p>Shahzad Control Center • Version 1.0</p>
<p>Yeh dashboard abhi interface hai; phone control aur login abhi configure nahi hue.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
